            "detailed_description": "<strong>Grind your way through Angelo's world! An epic and challenging skateboard game!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756680/extras/8b84ac86addfeaf1e4c4de78032b9dab.avif?t=1781885050\" width=600 height=210 /></span><br><br>Angelo - Skate Away is a brand new game based on the successful TV show Angelo Rules! <br>Play Angelo, Lola, Sherwood and many more characters in this epic skate game. <br>Enjoy skating through such iconic environments as the City, the School, Adventure Land or the Skate-park, in a fun and easy-to-get platformer.<br>Collect cupcakes and use them to unlock new levels, characters, hats, boards and tricks and become a very unique skater!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with Angelo and more than 15 other characters from the show.<br></li><li>Master 30+ levels and beat them by completing there objectives.<br></li><li>More than 30 unique hats to really enjoy the game YOUR way. <br></li><li>Battle your friends for leaderboard dominance. <br></li><li>Unlock more than 25 sick tricks!</li></ul>",
